{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_10_end",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_10",
  "title": "1:11A.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-10",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_10_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fad7a8c6e8ea86661fd29059bed4af89217bd22f2d911cdd5fb9c3c09fc8f0ea",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're just... going to watch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're just going to watch. But I have no idea what's happening."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "At least they're not hurting any civilians?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And there's so much good food going to waste..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I hate to see it too. But I guess a street fight is just part of the party."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was planned?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doesn't look like it. Oh, someone's coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Agh...! I think... I hit the wrong person..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isn't it kind of unsafe to stay here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I could go back to the office, but what would I even do there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't you have a test tomorrow? In the afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......Crap."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Those two seem as if they are uninvolved in this event."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We should ask them to leave. We would not want them to get hurt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Hold on, isn't that man up there with his belly cut open the Emperor of Penguin Logistics?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's dead. And you seem not at all bothered?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bothered? Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mr. Emperor gets himself into such trouble several times a month. We have grown accustomed to this behavior."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "His death?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Sounds like Mostima really shouldn't be getting close to you people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You worry about her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm just here to make sure she doesn't do anything out of line."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, hm, it's a really clumsy act. Since she looks so relaxed over there, I guess there isn't anything worth worrying about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm going for a walk. Don't tell her I came. I'll go see her myself when things quiet down."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...There she goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She shows up, asks her questions, and leaves just as suddenly as she appears."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is this the way they do things in Laterano now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Heh. I suddenly find myself envious of you young people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You always choose your own paths, thinking only of yourselves. You don't consider your places in the grand scheme of things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I also work hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But no one has ever been able to get to the bottom of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you ever really did, that would be the most frustrating of all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Indeed. There are some things that should not be so thoroughly investigated. Especially those things that have to do with Mostima the Messenger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is this? Occupational discrimination?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm only speaking from experience."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's take a break for a moment now."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My Arts are suppressed...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you were the one holding back your strength all this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As were you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But you have wasted enough time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seemingly Ordinary Resident",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This little punk, how can he keep fighting...? Grr..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*Pant pant* I can... keep going... all night..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yep. You're doing great."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good thing you were able to deal with so many bad guys so quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey. We won't let you disappear on your own this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So this guy's the evil mastermind pulling the strings here? I definitely owe him a personal beating!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We got ourselves one helluva workout today. And the bill's gettin' mighty long too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Texas, I'm thinkin' there's a lot we ain't gonna get to expense here tonight..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't ask me. That's a question for the boss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the boss is dead..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Then it'll have to wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Speaking of, did anybody go deal with the boss's corpse? Leaving him up there to get trampled feels kind of..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There we are. The players are assembled."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Young people always make their own choices."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even if it means walking through a Catastrophe, leaving your bodies splattered and broken, you still proceed with such determination."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is he talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just a grandpa's muttering. Don't worry about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right then. Are you enjoying your Sauin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "S'all right. Kinda like a hangover. No way I can think about what I gotta do tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So... nobody's going to take care of the boss?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Penguin Logistics, you truly are unfathomable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think we don't need to worry about that, considering."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's Penguin Logistics. The whole reason for this war was someone questioning the boss's tastes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sorry, what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He gave his life to preserve his style. That's our Emperor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I must say, not one of you ever surprised me in the slightest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mmmff! What's this sand?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He still has the strength?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes... everybody focus. This fight is going to be different."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you let your guard down for even a split second,"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You'll die."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sauin must be a lively event!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let me see with my own eyes the freaks that Emperor raised."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My blade broke the moment it touched the sand... that's a problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mmm. In all my years, those bold enough to approach me with blade or bullet were few and far between."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll give him one of these!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oof, no good! Croissant, you're up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My hammer's already stuck in the quicksand! I can't move!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hopeless. Is this all you have, Penguin Logistics?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's not all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "His sand shield is broken. Now, Exusiai!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's barrage time!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How many guns do you have? Troublesome angel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't even think about it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh? I've been blocked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thanks, Bison!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm up! Sorry fer the elder abuse!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aagh! Couldn't get him! Texas, yer up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wishful thinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I got this, Texas!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm, a voice-based Originium Art. What an interesting little girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How's your spatial awareness?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He even dodged from that angle..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "At least you made him move. When he takes us on just standing in one place, I feel like he's looking down on us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Oh, Penguin Logistics."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That coat was a gift from my daughter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In all these years, you are the first to even touch it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How many young people like you are in Lungmen? What are you capable of, actually?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's enough to just be yourself, isn't it? Or are you upset?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, I just find myself with some... complex feelings..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But it's getting terribly late now, so it's time I——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mmng?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He- he's been shot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's that sniper from before. He's still here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Target down. Moving to confirm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What have you done?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Young Master, he was a threat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You should never have gone so close to him. He has an affinity for Originium Arts. I could not guarantee your safety."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You must understand, the Young Master's safety is my number one priority."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...What you're saying is... I was bait?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My father knew this would happen, so he sent you to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Young Master."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Young Master, some things are not as they seem. You will come to understand in time. And I promise, the Master of the House had no intention of exploiting you at any time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And I believe Penguin Logistics will also be expecting an explanation. I must secure the Rat King's remains and confirm that he is deceased."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's fine. The boss is gone. There's no one to hear you explain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you for your understanding. Now, Young Master, do take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bison, now is not the time to dwell on this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Rat King promised us a 'gift', don't forget."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It might be a bomb. That Siracusan guy really liked bombs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That wouldn't be very clever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And there are still some enemies to worry about. It looks like they're waiting for us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Rat King is gone, and they don't seem to be reacting at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right, no reaction whatsoever. Hm... I think I know what's happening..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's split up. Sora, Croissant, Exusiai, we'll take care of the remaining enemies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bison and Mostima, you deal with the 'gift.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's almost sunrise. We're running out of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Damn, where could it be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're all flustered. Try not to be so emotional."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I did just find out that I was being kept in the dark about my whole purpose here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Mostima, did we actually, maybe meet the Rat King before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We did."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you had it all figured out from the beginning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ahahaha..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't try to wriggle out of this one!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm. I couldn't have guessed what he was really up to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But we really don't have much time. The LGD aren't going to sit on their hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As crazy as things have gotten around here, with them jumping in, there's no way we'd work it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Victorian gumdrops, the candy box, maybe that was a clue."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But it's just common sense that using the same kind of trap over again would be really dumb."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, but, why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If the Rat King really had everything planned out, then us running into him before couldn't be a coincidence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He was communicating with us from the start."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's his trap. Why would he want to give us clues? That doesn't make any sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know either, maybe we've been too quick to consider him an enemy...? I just have a feeling."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not just a feeling. After we met the Rat King, he kept trying to hint at something... or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mmm... Well, it's better than nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is it..?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like it's about 80cm by 40cm, but in an iron box... Yep, this definitely seems like a big gift box to me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Could- could you explain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nope. I don't get it at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then we better call up Texas, maybe she and the girls can——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's not enough time. This looks like it's got a timer on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So it's a bomb?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So it's a bomb. Pretty cliche. Both in shape and execution."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right... Mostima, you get out of here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And what are you going to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Take a chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is a custom shield, and my body is pretty tough too. If I play this wrong, I might still survive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you serious?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then I want to see how this plays out. And don't worry, I might be able to mitigate the damage from the explosion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's my job, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know. *Inhale*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*Exhale* Here I go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You decided? That wire's the same color as my hair."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Erm! M- Mostima! Don't joke with me please! I'm almost——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It hit zero! Get behind me!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay, okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nnnngg..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why isn't it hot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, this is... candy?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Pay attention to how you land. You don't want to break anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "ac5_7_back"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's that sound?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not sure, but... Woweee! There's people fallin' from the sky?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ow ow ow, why is this happening again... Agh! S- sorry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "S'all right. What're you two doin' up there? Playin' trapeze artist?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yowch! Somethin' just hit me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Candy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's raining... candy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ugh, it's that sickly sweet smell in the air again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think it's about time we wrapped this up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm? Um? Texas, do you know something we don't know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No. But I have a pretty solid idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey!! If you had a lead, you should've told us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sauin. It's long over."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King's Henchman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Wanna get dim sum?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So early? Let's go to the roof and watch the sunrise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King's Henchman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mafia types are funny. Always with the sunrise on the roof..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gah. This candy's smashed into my head so much I think I got brain damage. It's the signal to stop, and I stopped."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But boy, it's more like we just got beaten on. My whole body's so tender..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They... they all stopped. What's going on? This doesn't feel right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're all done, just like that? These fellers love candy so much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The candy rain stopped."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, so fleeting. If only it would truly rain candy someday."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So there was the candy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But wait, what about the bomb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mean this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? You took the whole thing apart?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mostima?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whoops, lost control there for a second. Hope you didn't get burned."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This looks like an ordinary metal box?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...And there's one piece of candy inside. Ew, it melted. It's all sticky..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And this note? Is it from the Rat King...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What does it say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Happy Sauin'..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": ".........Huh?"
    },
